OL,3,AIranian men accused of spying targeted
OL,4,Ajournalists for 'serious violence',
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree Iranian men have gone on trial in
OL,8,FLondon accused of spying for Iran on
OL,9,FUK-based journalists, who were being
OL,10,Ftargeted so "serious violence" could be
OL,11,Finflicted on them.
OL,13,FThe prosecution said Mostafa Sepahvand,
OL,14,F41, was to carry out the attack, with
OL,15,FFarhad Manesh, 46, and Shapoor Noori,
OL,16,F57, doing the surveillance and
OL,17,Freconnaissance. All three were born in
OL,18,FIran but were living in London.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
