OL,3,AIranian men accused of spying targeted
OL,4,Ajournalists for 'serious violence',
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury at Woolwich Crown Court heard
OL,8,Fthat Sepahvand does not deny his
OL,9,Finvolvement but said he did it out of
OL,10,Ffear of the consequences of refusing.
OL,12,FThe prosecution said that is "an
OL,13,Fentirely bogus claim", adding that he
OL,14,Fdid it for money and to have a criminal
OL,15,Fconviction for theft in Iran "fixed".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
